      "connection_topology": {
        "component_connections": "GestureRecognition→MultiModalInteraction；DriverMonitoring→MultiModalInteraction/InstrumentCluster/CenterDisplay；StreamingMirror→CenterDisplay；MultiModalInteraction→InstrumentCluster/CenterDisplay/HUDRenderer；MultiModalInteraction⇄VoiceAssistant；MultiModalInteraction→IC/CD/HUD控制调用。",
        "data_flow_paths": "IF_Gesture_Events_SR：Gesture→MMI；IF_DMS_State_SR：DMS→MMI/IC/CD；IF_Mirror_Video_SR：Mirror→CD；IF_IC_Frame_SR：MMI→IC；IF_CD_Frame_SR：MMI→CD；IF_HUD_AR_SR：MMI→HUD；IF_Voice_Dialog_CS：MMI⇄VA；IF_Display_Control_CS：MMI→IC/CD/HUD。",
        "control_flow_paths": "MMI作为统一控制器：调用VoiceAssistant进行语音理解与回应；调用Display_Control在IC/CD/HUD设置模式/亮度/告警；显示组件根据接收帧自驱渲染。"
      },
      "architecture_rationale": {
        "design_decisions": "采用S/R承载高频帧与状态，C/S承载控制与语音服务；MMI居中融合与调度，显示组件保持无状态渲染；AVB/TSN区分Class A(渲染关键帧)与Class B(状态/视频)，确保时延与带宽。",
        "tradeoff_analysis": "S/R提供低耦合和高吞吐；C/S适配请求-响应语义；MMI集中简化接口数量但增加单点负载；HUD与IC独立渲染减少互相影响；AVB/TSN带来网络配置复杂度但保证QoS。",
        "alternative_considerations": "可选方案：将VoiceAssistant拆分本地/云双层；StreamingMirror改为CD内置处理以减少链路；MMI分片为场景管理与渲染调度两组件以降低复杂度。",
        "risk_assessment": "风险：语音时延波动、TSN配置失当导致抖动、MMI过载影响帧分发、DMS阈值不当导致误报。缓解：异步队列与超时重试、带宽预留与时钟同步监控、MMI性能剖析与负载均衡、参数动态调优。"
      },
